- Phase 2: real Bun.serve presence convergence + mutability test
- Phase 3: cross-session fan-out (N sessions created independently)
- Phase 4: background spawn (Effect pattern — returns immediately, consume result)
- Phase 5: task_id resume (parentID unchanged, prompt directed to child)
- Phase 6: daemon spawn + dedup (covered in hivemind-memory.test.ts)
- Phase 7: source-fork ephemeral (depth-1 fork, source untouched, cleanup on consume)
- Phase 8: bidirectional inbox (POST endpoint shape + message order)
- Phase 11: daemon orchestrator depth (covered in hivemind-memory.test.ts)
- Phase 12: deferred to Stage 12 E2E harness
- memory plugin: added concurrent write dedup + orchestrator-depth tests
- presence: added N-client convergence + kill-drop scenario test
